(55,'Order of the Lions Paw of Kenmare','Northkeep - Lion','""','Baronial Service Award that grants an Award of Arms and as such requires Crown approval.','Badge of the order worn as a medallion','(Fieldless) In chevron a tower sable sustained by two lion’s gambes erased Or.','',7,2,25,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(56,'Order of the Mark','Mark','""','Peerage for Missile related activities in the SCA including Archery, Thrown Weapons, Siege Engineering, and other activities.','','','',5,4,2,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(58,'Order of the Bastion of Vindheim','Vind - Bastion','""','Persons who exemplify the spirit of the Dream in Vindheim and inspire the populace to greater deeds and service. The candidate should be a person that Vindheim relies upon for the betterment of the Principality, using their skills and talents, and by whose absence the Principality would be greatly deprived of a valuable member.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(59,'Award of the Brazier of Vindheim','Vind - Brazier','["Martial Endeavors as Art","Martial Endeavors as Service"]','Persons who have used their martial skills to enhance artistry or assist the service community. The candidate should use their skills and talents to contribute to the betterment of Vindheim or its subordinate communities. The Award may be given to an individual more than once, but only for the reasons listed.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(60,'Award of the Key of Keys of Vindheim','Vind - Key of Keys','""','Persons who have given especial service in attendance to the persons of the Vindheim Coronet(s). The candidate should exemplify the pinnacle of service and respect for the Vindheim Coronet(s), the laws of the Principality of Vindheim, and the Kingdom of Ansteorra.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(61,'Award of the Key of Vindheim','Vind - Key','""','Persons who have faithfully served in attendance to the Vindheim Coronet(s). The candidate should exemplify faithful service and respect for the Vindheim Coronet(s), the laws of the Principality of Vindheim, and the Kingdom of Ansteorra.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(62,'Order of the Fountain of Vindheim','Vind - Fountain','["Art as Service","Art in support of Marshallate"]','Persons who have offered public service to others and the Vindheim community through the arts and science or a martial aspect, including but not limited to bardcraft, music, vocal heraldry, and dance. The candidate should use their skills and talents to contribute to the ambiance, atmosphere, and splendor of Vindheim in our public spaces.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(63,'Order of the Golden Comb of Vindheim','Vind - Golden Comb','""','Younger members of the Society that have not reached their majority shall be recognized for service above that which is normally expected of them.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(64,'Order of the Goutte de Vin of Vindheim','Vind - Goutte','""','Persons who have served the Principality through provision of original award scrolls.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(65,'Award of the Pillar of Vindheim','Vind - Pillar','[]','Persons who have offered notable service to  Vindheim through the gift of their time or organizational skills. The candidate should use their skills and talents to contribute to the betterment of Vindheim or its subordinate communities.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(66,'Order of the Sanguine Bowl of Vindheim','Vind - Sanguine Bowl','""','Persons who embody the spirit of Vindheim even though they are not residents thereof. The inductee should reside outside the borders of Vindheim and exhibit love, dedication, and service which truly embodies the Vindheim ideal.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(67,'Award of the River of Vindheim','Vind - River','""','Persons who have demonstrated excellence in period style, display, or fidelity.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(68,'Award of the Thunderbolt of Vindheim','Vind - Thunderbolt','""','Persons who have distinguished themselves to the Coronet in an extraordinary fashion. The candidate should show an example of phenomenal prowess, extraordinary artistry, or remarkable service.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(69,'Award of the Wellspring of Vindheim','Vind - Wellspring','""','Persons who have served the Principality through static arts.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(70,'Award of the Sanguine Company of Vindheim','Vind - Sanguine','["Armoured Combat","Rapier Combat","Steel Combat","Combat Archery","Target Archery","Siege Combat","Thrown Weapons","Youth Rapier Combat","Youth Armoured Combat","Equestrian Deeds of Arms"]','Recognition of those who take on the burden of representing Vindheim well in foreign lands. These persons shall increase the recognition or improve upon the reputation of Vindheim while engaging in marshal activities. The Award may be given to an individual more than once, but only once for a particular marshallate field.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(71,'Award of the Sinople Company of Vindheim','Vind - Sinople','["Fiber Arts","Culinary Arts","Performance Arts","Household Arts","Metal Arts","Research","Tangible Heraldry","Husbandry"]','Recognition of those who take on the burden of representing Vindheim well in foreign lands. These persons shall increase the recognition or improve upon the reputation of Vindheim while engaging in art or science activities. The Award may be given to an individual more than once, but only once for a particular art or science field.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(72,'Award of the Tenne Company of Vindheim','Vind - Tenne','["Group Management","Event Administration","Infrastructure","General Assistance","Event Operations"]','Recognition of those who take on the burden of representing Vindheim well in foreign lands. These persons shall increase the recognition or improve upon the reputation of Vindheim while engaging in service activities. The Award may be given to an individual more than once, but only once for a particular type of service.','','','',11,1,11,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(73,'Award of the Dragon''s Egg','Bryn - Egg','""','"We honor the contributions of youth to our Barony of Bryn Gwlad. Hear now, young gentles, you are hereby named a recipient of the Dragon’s Egg, in recognition of courtesy, service, and enthusiasm, that you may continue to inspire others."','','','',7,1,33,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(74,'Award of the Cross Fleury','Bryn - Cross','""','"The warriors of Bryn Gwlad are admired for their skills and courage. These gentles have defended our lands and our people with great honor, and are hereby awarded the Cross Fleury of Bryn Gwlad."','','','',7,1,33,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(75,'Award of the Golden Martlet','Bryn - Martlet','""','"The Golden Martlet is a non-armigerous baronial award to honor service to the Barony of Bryn Gwlad."','','','',7,1,33,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(76,'Award of the Muse','Bryn - Muse','""','"The beauty of Bryn Gwlad is a gift for all who gather here. Recipients of this award are highly admired artisans whose skills have enriched our barony, and are hereby awarded the Muse of Bryn Gwlad."','','','',7,1,33,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(77,'Award of the Silver Chalice','Bryn - Chalice','""','"The quality of one’s character is highly prized in our Society. The persona of these gentles has greatly enriched the Barony of Bryn Gwlad, and with these words are hereby awarded the Silver Chalice of Bryn Gwlad."','','','',7,1,33,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(78,'Keeper of the Crucible','Hellsgate - Crucible','""','"The Keeper of the Crucible is an award given by the Lord and Lady of Hellsgate to recognize works of Arts and Sciences within our Stronghold of Hellsgate."','','','',7,1,38,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(79,'Keeper of the Flame','Hellsgate - Flame','""','"The Keeper of the Flame is an award given by the Lord and Lady of Hellsgate to recognize acts of service to our Stronghold of Hellsgate."','','','',7,1,38,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(80,'Keeper of the Gate','Hellsgate - Gate','""','"The Keeper of the Gate is an award given by the Lord and Lady of Hellsgate to recognize skill in combat shown within our Stronghold of Hellsgate."','','','',7,1,38,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(127,'Award of the Ursae Animus','Bjornsborg - Animus','""','Award of the Ursae Animus (Heart of the Bear):  This is the Bjornsborg award for our closest advisors. It is given at the discretion of the B&B to those who we trust to give us the best advice on how to make the Barony better for everyone.','','','',7,1,41,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(128,'Award of the Ursae Alkaid','Bjornsborg - Alkaid','""',E'Award of the Ursae Alkaid (Stars of the Bear): This is an award for anyone who does something that impresses the Bjornsborg B&B, in any area of our game.\r\n','','','',7,1,41,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(129,'Award of the Ursae Amicus','Bjornsborg - Amicus','""','Award of the Ursae Amicus (Friends of the Bear): This is a service order for those who live outside of Bjornsborg that have done service for the Barony. Given at the discretion of the B&B.','','','',7,1,41,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(130,'Award of the Rising Storm of Namron','Namron - Storm','""','The Rising Storm of Namron is awarded to youth members for bringing honor and glory to themselves and to the Barony through service, marshallate activities, and/or the arts and sciences.','','','',7,1,18,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(131,'Award of the Torsade','Namron - Torsade','""','The Torsade is the Barony’s service award and is presented by the current Landed Nobility of Namron. The colors of the Torsade represent past Barons and Baronesses. This award is given when an individual has worked to help the Barony at a number of events and throughout the year in other activities, and helps to improve the Barony of Namron.','Torsade','','',7,1,18,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(132,'Award of the Argent Fleur','Namron - Fleur','""','The Argent Fleur is an Arts and Sciences award and is presented by the current Landed Nobility of Namron. This award is given to those individuals who enrich the culture of Namron through their skill in the creation and/or performance of period items. These skills can be for a wide range of activities and talents that cover all we see and do in the SCA.','Argent Fleur ','','',7,1,18,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(133,'Award of the Ascia Rossa','Namron - Ascia','""','The Ascia Rossa is a marshalate award and is presented by the current Landed Nobility of Namron. The symbol is a red fighting axe with a black Namron storm on it. This award is given to those members in the marshallate community who bring the honor and glory to Namron and helps to protect her lands. The Premier recipient of this award is Barone Orlando. This award was designed and created by Barone Orlando and Baronessa Caterina prior to their investiture. At the step down court of Baron Donnchadh he surprised everyone by presenting the premier award to Barone Orlando before their investiture.','','','',7,1,18,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(134,'The Flying Cow of Namron','Namron - Cow','""','The Order of the Flying Cow is our newest award and is presented by the current Landed Nobility of Namron. This award is given to those members in the community who bring the silly joy of shenanigans to Namron and helps to make the populace and their excellencies smile. This does include a stipulation that the shenanigans should never damage property or hurt others. The Premier recipients of this award are Don Cornelius Merilainen, Honorable Lady Anastasiia Dmitrieva Sokolova, and Lord Klaus Luistra. This award was created by Baronessa Isabella and Baroness Emma at their first Beltane event as landed.','','','',7,1,18,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(135,'Order of the Kriegshelt','Namron - Kriegshelt','""','The Order of the Krieghelt is a polling order. All appointments are made under the counsel of the Order. This award carries no Order of Precedence (OP), but carries great prestige. It is the highest Baronial award that may be given, and is given by the Landed Nobility of Namron, for lifelong service to the Barony.','','(Fieldless) A pile wavy couped argent','',7,1,18,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(136,'Award of the Gilded Girnch','Eldern - Girnch','""','This is the Eldern Hills Non-Armigerous Award recognizing service to the Barony.','','','',7,1,17,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(137,'Award of the Argent Bison','Eldern - ArgentBison','""','The Argent Bison, named for the white bison supported on the Baronial Achievement (coat of arms), is a special service award for individuals that have dedicated significant time to serving the Barony.','','','',7,1,17,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(138,'Award of the Bison''s Might','Eldern - Might','""','Bison''s Might is awarded by the Landed Nobility of Eldern Hills for exemplary performance of the field of combat.','','','',7,1,17,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(139,'Award of the Argent Flame','Eldern - Flame','""','The Argent Flame is awarded by the Landed Nobility of Eldern Hills for teaching and furthering others pursuits of the arts and sciences.','','','',7,1,17,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(140,'Flint and Steel of Wiesenfeuer','Wiesen - Flint','""','Non-armigerous Baronial Service Award. Typically the first group award given for service.','','','',7,1,20,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(141,'Golden Beacon of Wiesenfeuer','Wiesen - Beacon','""',E'Non-amigerous Baronial award given to those who give their time and knowledge in support of the marshallate activities through training, building supplies, helping others, etc.\r\n','','','',7,1,20,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(142,'Flamme d’ Orleans of Wiesenfeuer','Wiesen - Orleans','""','Non-amigerous Baronial award given to those that serve the Barony with their Arts and Sciences. This is through teaching, level of skill, and using the skill to better the group.','','','',7,1,20,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
(143,'Spark of Wiesenfeuer','Wiesen - Spark','""','Non-amigerous Baronial award for the youth or those that work with the youth.','','','',7,1,20,'2026-08-26 00:00:00','2026-08-26 00:00:00',1,1,NULL),
